{"name":"Shelter","hex":"#b8986c","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"shelter","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Somewhere one can find protection.\nA place where a person or animal may find protection from the elements (especially rain, storms, or cold) sometimes as a place to sleep (such as a cave).","A place where a person or animal may find protection from the elements (especially rain, storms, or cold) sometimes as a place to sleep (such as a cave)."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To provide cover from damage or harassment; to shield; to protect.","To take cover."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/shelter"}],"entries":[{"title":"Shelter","blocks":[{"text":"A shelter is an architectural structure or natural formation providing protection from the local environment. A shelter can serve as a home or be provided by a residential institution. It can be understood as both a temporary and a permanent structure. In the American Counterculture of the 1960s, the concept of \"Shelter\" intervenes as one of the key concepts of the Whole Earth Catalog, and expresses an alternative to the modes of teaching architecture practiced in American academies."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shelter"},{"title":"Shelter (2026 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Shelter is a 2026 action thriller film starring Jason Statham as a former British government assassin living in isolation off the coast of Scotland who is forced back into violent confrontation with his past while protecting a young girl from the agency determined to eliminate him. It is directed by Ric Roman Waugh and written by Ward Parry. The film also stars Bodhi Rae Breathnach, Bill Nighy, Naomi Ackie, and Daniel Mays."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/eb/Shelter_2026_poster.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shelter_(2026_film)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/Shelter_6_picnic_shelter_at_Cam-Plex_Park_in_Campbell_County%2C_Wyoming.jpg/500px-Shelter_6_picnic_shelter_at_Cam-Plex_Park_in_Campbell_County%2C_Wyoming.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/Shelter_6_picnic_shelter_at_Cam-Plex_Park_in_Campbell_County%2C_Wyoming.jpg/960px-Shelter_6_picnic_shelter_at_Cam-Plex_Park_in_Campbell_County%2C_Wyoming.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/Shelter_6_picnic_shelter_at_Cam-Plex_Park_in_Campbell_County%2C_Wyoming.jpg/500px-Shelter_6_picnic_shelter_at_Cam-Plex_Park_in_Campbell_County%2C_Wyoming.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AShelter_6_picnic_shelter_at_Cam-Plex_Park_in_Campbell_County%2C_Wyoming.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Bugac_shelter.JPG/500px-Bugac_shelter.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6c/Bugac_shelter.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Bugac_shelter.JPG/500px-Bugac_shelter.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABugac_shelter.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Maasai_shelter.jpg/500px-Maasai_shelter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Maasai_shelter.jpg/960px-Maasai_shelter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/M